From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ucode: publish inline AP WPS settings through their native owner

An inline AP configuration has no standalone configuration-file owner to
accept received WPS settings. Return the exact BSS and validated settings to
its existing ucode owner, and report protocol success only after that owner
accepts publication. Preserve standalone and external credential processing.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
---

